      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# PixText model download\n\nOpen this workflow to see ComfyUI's missing-model download prompt. Choose **Download** for the selected model.\n\nDesktop can place the weights for you. With Portable or a browser, save the file as `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/PixText-MeanFlow.safetensors`, then refresh the model list. Rename `model.safetensors` if your browser uses that name. Remote ComfyUI needs the file on the server.\n\nConfiguration and fonts are included with the nodes. Existing complete model packages still work.\n\n[Download selected weights](https://huggingface.co/ATH-MaaS/PixText/resolve/main/models/PixText-MeanFlow/model.safetensors) · [All PixText models](https://huggingface.co/ATH-MaaS/PixText)"
      ],
      "color": "#28443f",
      "bgcolor": "#18262d"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "OCR model downloads",
      "pos": [
        850,
        -200
      ],
      "size": [
        940,
        290
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# OCR model downloads · one-time setup\n\nDownload these three files before running Detect Words. Save them on the machine running ComfyUI.\n\n1. [CRAFT ZIP](https://github.com/JaidedAI/EasyOCR/releases/download/pre-v1.1.6/craft_mlt_25k.zip): extract **craft_mlt_25k.pth** into `ComfyUI/models/pixtext_ocr/`.\n2. [PP-OCRv6 weights · inference.onnx](https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PP-OCRv6_medium_rec_onnx/resolve/50c7eacafc52fa7bcf4194e8cd08e46f8558504b/inference.onnx?download=true)\n3. [PP-OCRv6 dictionary · inference.yml](https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PP-OCRv6_medium_rec_onnx/resolve/50c7eacafc52fa7bcf4194e8cd08e46f8558504b/inference.yml?download=true)\n\nSave both PP-OCRv6 files in `ComfyUI/models/pixtext_ocr/PP-OCRv6_medium_rec_onnx/`.\n\nFrom the PixText node folder, install dependencies with ComfyUI's Python: `python -m pip install -r requirements-ocr.txt`, then restart. After saving the models, click **Run** and review the detected boxes."
      ],
      "color": "#35465a",
      "bgcolor": "#18262d"
    }
